solvation in water (pKa-relevant calculation).
$end

$molecule
1 1
N   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
C   0.000000   0.000000   1.490000
H   1.013000   0.000000  -0.342000
H  -0.507000   0.878000  -0.342000
